  Okay. I'll just do it the long way. But I put a time limit on how
much I would bring out: 3 days with an option to 4, depending on how
well my patience was holding. No more. The rest would have to wait for
another time.
  
  So off to the task at hand...

  Many trips of hauling booty ensued between; the cache on Home level
1, and base camp on dungeon level 24 of the Mazes of Menace.

